    {
      "id": "field-representations",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Representations",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 200
      },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Representations",
        "body": "A Property’s card shows its name, its type, and its value as a control that suits the type: a field, a number box, a switch, or a box for JSON. The value can be changed there without opening the editor. A class can supply a more specific presentation, including its own control, without changing the distinction from graph identity.",
